  "description": "2018 BMW 330e (F30 PHEV). CONFIRMED on-vehicle: HV-battery SOC and other data via STANDARD J1979 PIDs on ECU 7EB/7E8. The proprietary SME DIDs (6F1/607, from i3) do NOT respond on this car's OBD-II bus (SME is on an internal BMW bus not bridged to the port).",
