    "derivedFrom": "OBDb/BMW-i3s (CC BY-SA 4.0) \u2014 shares the SME battery-ECU architecture and addressing with the F30 330e",
    "confidence": "Standard J1979 PIDs (015B SOC, 015C oil, 0146 ambient, 012F fuel, 0142 voltage): CONFIRMED live on the 330e. SME 6F1 DIDs (SOH/cell V/cell temp): present in set but NO DATA on this vehicle's OBD port \u2014 kept for reference / other buses.",
    "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0"
  },
